    "title": "Downtown Ithaca's 43rd Annual Apple Harvest Festival Happening Sept. 26-28 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Alecia Solorzano ,\n55 minutes ago ITHACA, N.Y. (WENY) -- The 43rd Annual Apple Harvest Festival is just around the corner. Ithaca's signature fall celebration is happening this year from September 26-28. Festivities kick off at 12:00 P.M. on Friday, September 26, and last through 8:00 P.M. On both Saturday, September 27, and Sunday, September 28, the festival is on from 10:00 A.M. to 6:00 P.M. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
